{"id":"n40768-1-7","stage":3,"title":"놀이터 · 游乐场","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40768-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 지수는 어디 갔어요?","zh":"妈妈，智秀去哪儿了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"갔어요?","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔어요","audio":"/audio/b1b0024d83172adc2137.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9e65a6dabb58a0f537ef.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40768-1-7-2","ko":"그네를 타러 간다고 했으니 아마 집 앞 놀이터에 있을 거야.","zh":"她说要去玩秋千，应该是在家门口的游乐场吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그네를","meaning":"秋千","explanation":"그네：秋千；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"그네","audio":"/audio/4d98b83e11caa525be2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36243","senseId":"1","lemma":"그네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그네를","audio":"/audio/d919bbdadc37bc528b50.mp3"}},{"text":"타러","meaning":"荡，坐（秋千）","explanation":"타다：荡，坐（秋千）；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타러","audio":"/audio/dc1f88b05849fdbc6221.mp3"}},{"text":"간다고","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간다고","audio":"/audio/77933c96d4b000321758.mp3"}},{"text":"했으니","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했으니","audio":"/audio/7413e77c37316c797660.mp3"}},{"text":"아마","meaning":"也许","explanation":"아마：也许。","readings":[{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71248","senseId":"1","lemma":"아마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}},{"text":"집","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}},{"text":"앞","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}},{"text":"놀이터에","meaning":"游乐场","explanation":"놀이터：游乐场；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"놀이터","audio":"/audio/cac9ffa4c39d8c15ba9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40768","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀이터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀이터에","audio":"/audio/69cddecad82d398de055.mp3"}},{"text":"있을","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을","audio":"/audio/e77f5d4b360ff618b52e.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4d98b83e11caa525","term":"그네","zh":"秋千","audio":"/audio/4d98b83e11caa525be2b.mp3","entryId":"36243","definition":"乘着悬挂在一个长垂下来的踏板或坐板上，来回晃动身体的一个游戏工具。","pronunciation":["그ː네"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"荡，坐（秋千）","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"荡，坐（秋千）","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"2a38de25ef5f5194","term":"아마","zh":"也许","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3","entryId":"71248","definition":"虽然不能说得很明确，猜测或估计很有可能地。","pronunciation":["아마"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"cac9ffa4c39d8c15","term":"놀이터","zh":"游乐场","audio":"/audio/cac9ffa4c39d8c15ba9f.mp3","entryId":"40768","definition":"设有滑梯或秋千等器具、供孩子们玩乐的地方。","pronunciation":["노리터"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/395dba1698e2972614c9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.097,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40768","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":119,"sequenceScore":3.4004,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，智秀去哪儿了？","她说要去玩秋千，应该是在家门口的游乐场吧。","我和女后辈吃了顿饭，女朋友特别生气。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，智秀去哪儿了？","她说要去玩秋千，应该是在家门口的游乐场吧。","我和女后辈吃了顿饭，女朋友特别生气。"],"answer":1}]}
